 5100MPa, stretch modulus is at 270 ~ 310GPa, and filament diameter is the carbon fiber of 6-10 μm.",manual,https://patents.google.com/patent/CN105401262A/en?oq=CN105401262A,,user provided claim text — batch import; user copied from Google Patents or patent publication
